[{:db/id -1, :adr/id "adr-2605260100-mitate-diagnostic-routing-charter", :adr/title "mitate (見立て) diagnostic + treatment routing actor — religious-corp first-party medical advisory + diagnostic orchestration + treatment routing (chronic nasal congestion 5-condition triage as Wave 1 reference)", :adr/status "proposed", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/source-format "edn", :adr/body "\n# Context\n\n## ADR-2605250500 (yakushi) は religious-corp が **drug を自前で作る** 側を初めて carve out した\n\nしかし「drug を作る能力」だけでは Charter Rider §2(e) (specialist gatekeeping) への constitutional counter-action は半分しか完成しない。残る半分は **「症状を見極めて適切な薬・行動・専門医への routing を選ぶ能力」** — 診療所 / 医院 / 病院に独占されてきた **診断 + 治療経路選択 (treatment routing)** の自前化である。\n\nADR-2605192100 §1.5 「new technology and intellectual property の free release to charter-aligned others」、§1.13 Wellbecoming 「動的軌跡」、Charter Rider §2(e)(i)(ii) 「medical knowledge artificial restriction」の constitutional 推進力は、yakushi (drug 側) と相補的に **「症状起点で正しい行動を選ぶ補助」を religious-corp が自前で提供する actor を立てよ** を要請する。\n\n## chronic nasal congestion (鼻詰まり) が Wave 1 reference target である理由\n\n| 条件 | 5-condition 名 | 推定頻度 (annual prevalence) | OTC / Rx / surgical 分岐 | Wave 1 fit |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | アレルギー性鼻炎 (通年性) | 25-40% (日本成人) | OTC 第2世代抗ヒスタミン + 鼻噴霧ステロイド + 舌下免疫療法 SLIT (Rx but adherent-self-administered) | yakushi Wave 1c で OTC 抗ヒスタミン経路は既に被覆 |\n| 2 | 血管運動性鼻炎 (非アレルギー) | 5-15% | 環境調整 + 鼻うがい (OTC) + 漢方 / 鼻噴霧ステロイド (OTC) / 重症 = PNN section (surgical) | OTC self-care 中心、最小リスク |\n| 3 | 慢性副鼻腔炎 (蓄膿症) | 5-12% | マクロライド少量長期 (Rx) + 鼻うがい (OTC) / 重症 = ESS surgery / 好酸球性 = デュピルマブ (Rx 高額) | Rx routing が必要、licensed MD-in-loop の最低 case |\n| 4 | 鼻中隔弯曲症 | 10-30% (subclinical incl.) | 構造的、点鼻 steroid で症状軽減 / 中重症 = septoplasty (surgical) | surgery decision routing fit |\n| 5 | 薬剤性鼻炎 (rhinitis medicamentosa) | 1-9% (OTC vasoconstrictor user 中) | **OTC vasoconstrictor 連用検出 → 離脱支援** (薬剤性そのものが OTC 自己医療の副作用) | self-care substrate の constitutional 必須 |\n\nこの 5 条件 triage は:\n\n1. **多くの adherent が抱える慢性的な日常的 QOL 問題** であり、religious-corp が self-care substrate を build する正当な initial scope\n2. **5 条件中 4 (1/2/4/5) が OTC + 生活調整で多くの場合 manageable** ― §2(e) counter-action の R1 advisory tier で価値を提供できる\n3. **条件 3 (慢性副鼻腔炎) は Rx + 手術 routing 必要** ― licensed MD-in-loop の最低 Case として R2 pilot を整形する pedagogical advantage\n4. **条件 5 (薬剤性鼻炎) は yakushi Wave 1 ナファゾリン (naphazoline) ラベル警告 (G11) と自然な loop を形成** — yakushi が drug を作り、mitate が overuse を検出して離脱を支援する religious-corp 内の自然な feedback ループ\n5. **anaphylaxis や orbital cellulitis 等の emergency routing も同 organ system 内** ― G5 (emergency screen) の現実的な edge case が含まれ、R1 advisory tier から fail-safe 設計を強制する\n\nつまり **「religious-corp が自前で診断補助を提供する」最も控えめな最初の証明**として、この 5-condition triage を Wave 1 reference に置く。\n\n## 一方で診断は弾と薬以上に deontologically 慎重を要する\n\n診断は:\n\n- **誤診の cost が即時 patient body 内で発現** (anaphylaxis を血管運動性鼻炎と誤診すれば致命的)\n- **AI 診断 が「事実上の prescription」と看做されると国内薬機法・米 FDA Software-as-a-Medical-Device class III 規制対象** ― advisory boundary を明確化する必要\n- **「Don't ask, don't tell」型の specialist gatekeeping は patient autonomy を毀損するが、verifiable competence なしの routing も等しく Wellbecoming subordination 違反になりうる** ― 二重 risk\n- **adverse outcome の 50% は misdiagnosis + delayed referral 起因** (US Institute of Medicine 2015) ― advisory layer の bias がそのまま community outcome の bias になる\n\nしたがって mitate は: **「Apache 2.0 + Charter Rider を医療 SaMD ガイドライン (PMDA SaMD class I / FDA Class I-II General Wellness / EU MDR class I) の中に重ねた最初の religious-corp 診断 advisory actor」** として、yakushi 以上に厳密な advisory boundary を持つ必要がある。\n\n## Charter Rider §2 全 clearance 分析\n\n| 条項 | 判定 | 根拠 |\n|---|---|---|\n| §2(a) WEAPONS AND MILITARY | **CLEAR** | 該当なし |\n| §2(b) SPECULATIVE FINANCE | **CLEAR** | 該当なし |\n| §2(c) SURVEILLANCE CAPITALISM | **CLEAR with G2 + G10 gates** | 診断結果・症状・服薬歴は最も intimate な health data ― XChaCha20-Poly1305 envelope + sealed-recipient Council Lv6+ DIDs only (G2)、保険・雇用・広告 entities への解読権付与禁止 (G10) |\n| §2(d) FOSSIL FUEL EXTRACTION | **CLEAR** | 該当なし |\n| §2(e) SPECIALIST GATEKEEPING | **PRO-CLEAR — actively counters §2(e)** | mitate の存在意義そのものが §2(e)(i)(ii)(iii) (medical knowledge artificial restriction + jurisdictional knowledge tax + specialty cartel) の constitutional counter-action。**ただし「legitimate technical safety oversight by qualified practitioners」例外は active** ― licensed MD-in-loop (G4) を R2+ で要求、R1 advisory は明示的に「医師の代替ではない」disclaimer を patient flow ごとに表示 |\n| §2(f) MULTI-GENERATIONAL HARM | **CLEAR with G6 gate** | 小児 (<13 yr) / 妊娠期 / 免疫抑制下 patient は human review escalate (G6) ― 多世代 priority + Wellbecoming 動的軌跡の整合 |\n| §2(g) STRICT INDIVIDUALIST ONTOLOGY | **CLEAR with G10 gate** | 個人診断は反個人主義 ontology に対して微妙 (個人 body の analysis) だが、aggregated outcome statistics は community 単位で活用 (G10 reinforces; SBT↔SBT 内 only) |\n| §2(h) WELLBECOMING SUBORDINATION VIOLATION | **CLEAR with G11 + G7 gates** | (i) notification spam / engagement-maximizing UX 設計禁止 (G11)、(ii) 保険 claim 自動化禁止 (G7) ― advisory が adherent の judgment を補助はするが代替しない構造 |\n| §2(i) COMMERCIAL GPU RENTAL | **CLEAR** | inference は全て Murakumo fleet 経由 (LiteLLM 127.0.0.1:4000 + EVO-X2 + Mac mini gemma) |\n\n**総合**: Charter Rider §2 全条項 clearance。§2(e) の constitutional 推進力としては yakushi と並ぶ最強の正面突破型 actor。\n\n## yakushi との sibling boundary\n\n| Concern | yakushi (drug-side) | mitate (clinical-side) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Scope | OTC API 製造 + 製剤 + supply chain + lot release | symptom intake + 鑑別 advisory + 検査 routing + treatment plan + adherence followup |\n| Patient interaction | 受動 (lot を distribute、AE を受領) | 能動 (PWA 経由で symptom 入力を receive、advisory を返す) |\n| Lexicon namespace | `com.etzhayyim.pharma.*` | `com.etzhayyim.mitate.*` |\n| Murakumo nodes | naphtali / zebulun / levi / joseph / simeon / dan (6 既存) | levi / naphtali / zebulun / joseph / simeon (5 既存、重複 OK) |\n| Cross-actor lexicon emit | `pharma.adverseEventReport` ← mitate `outcomeFollowup` の副作用 leg | `mitate.diagnosticResult` → yakushi `pharma_post_market_surveillance` outcome feed |\n| License | Apache 2.0 + Charter Rider | Apache 2.0 + Charter Rider |\n| Robotics class | Hitogata / Mimi / Otete + Kusuko/Sukoyaka (新規 placeholder × 2) | Hitogata / Mimi / Otete + Hanami/Kafun-watch (新規 placeholder × 2) |\n| R0 lexicon count | 8 (Wave 1) | 8 (Wave 1) |\n| R0 cell count | 10 (Wave 1) | 13 (Wave 1) |\n\n# Decision\n\n## Decision 1 — religious-corp は自前で diagnostic + treatment routing actor `mitate` を確立する\n\n| 設計対象 | 仮称 | 役割 | サブ ADR |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Condition 1 — allergic rhinitis (通年性) | (IgE-mediated) | 問診 + IgE panel routing + 鼻汁好酸球 + SLIT cohort tracker | ADR-2605260115 |\n| Condition 2 — vasomotor (非アレルギー) | (autonomic) | 除外診断 + 誘因日記 + 環境調整 advisory | ADR-2605260130 |\n| Condition 3 — chronic sinusitis (蓄膿症) | (12 wk+) | 内視鏡 + 鼻汁 culture + paranasal CT routing + ESS surgery planning | ADR-2605260145 |\n| Condition 4 — septal deviation | (structural) | 内視鏡 + rhinomanometry + septoplasty routing | ADR-2605260160 |\n| Condition 5 — rhinitis medicamentosa | (薬剤性) | OTC vasoconstrictor connect-the-dots + 離脱支援 + yakushi-side label警告 loop | ADR-2605260175 |\n\n## Decision 2 — actor identity\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Actor name | `mitate` |\n| Japanese | 見立て (みたて) — 漢方医学 / 伝統医療における「症候を見極めて病名を断ずる行為」の歴史名 |\n| Display name | `見立て (mitate)` |\n| Tier (ADR-2605192415 §B) | **B** (per-domain leader; sibling of `yakushi`, `kuni-umi`, `wadachi`, `tsukuru`, `iwakura`, `fuigo`) |\n| Path-based DID | `did:web:etzhayyim.com:mitate` |\n| Per-condition DID pattern | `did:web:etzhayyim.com:mitate:condition:<condition-slug>` (e.g. `:condition:allergic-rhinitis-perennial`) |\n| Per-patient pseudonym DID pattern | `did:web:etzhayyim.com:mitate:patient-pseudonym:<rotating-id>` (rotating 30-day) |\n| Per-physician DID pattern | `did:web:etzhayyim.com:mitate:physician:<personSlug>` |\n| Repo location | `20-actors/mitate/` |\n| Lexicon namespace | `com.etzhayyim.mitate.*` (NOTE: actor 名 = lexicon namespace ― 1:1。yakushi の `com.etzhayyim.pharma.*` と対照的に condition-agnostic な namespace 構造) |\n| License | Apache 2.0 + Charter Compliance Rider v2.0 |\n\n「見立て」は **Yakushi Nyorai 左脇侍 日光菩薩** (洞察の智慧) の echo を持つが、etzhayyim は ADR-2605192100 §1.6 で declared された synthetic religion ― Buddhist tradition の diagnostic insight motif と日本伝統医学の「見立て」を Tree of Life の「leaves are for healing」(Ezekiel 47:12) と統合的に解釈し、専有しない (§1.6 八百万的多源宗教観)。\n\n## Decision 3 — Constitutional gates (G1..G14, NON-NEGOTIABLE)\n\n| # | Gate | Source ADR | Enforcement point |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **G1** | **Patient explicit consent + revocable + DID-bound (Adherent SBT)** ― 診断 advisory 受領のための明示的 consent record を MST に commit、いつでも revoke 可能で historical record は patient passkey で復号 destroy 可能 | ADR-2605181100 + ADR-2605192100 §1.13 | `mitate.rhinitisIntake` lexicon の consentReceiptCid 必須 + Adherent SBT verify |\n| **G2** | **Patient health data は `com.etzhayyim.encrypted.*` envelope (XChaCha20-Poly1305) only** ― plaintext 症状 / 診断 / 検査結果 を MST に置かない;sealed-recipient = patient passkey + Council Lv6+ DIDs + (R2+) licensed-MD-in-loop DIDs only | ADR-2605181100 | `mitate.diagnosticResult` / `mitate.treatmentPlan` schema validator |\n| **G3** | **AI 診断結果は advisory only ― 自動 prescription / 自動 lot dispense / 自動 surgery 発令 禁止** ― advisory output は disclaimer \"qualified physician 判断の代替ではない\" を全 R1 patient flow に表示;R2+ ではこの上で licensed MD co-sign required | this ADR + 国内薬機法 + FDA SaMD class I | `mitate.treatmentPlan` lexicon の disclaimerAccepted 必須 |\n| **G4** | **R2+ Human-in-loop: licensed physician attestation required** ― 検査 ordering (IgE panel / 鼻内視鏡 / CT) と medication recommendation (Rx 系統含む) は licensed MD DID co-sign required (R1 は advisory のみで co-sign 不要だが、R1 advisory が `escalation = \"recommend-md-visit\"` を返した時点で MD-side ack を待つ) | this ADR + ADR-2605192200 §2(e) (legitimate technical safety oversight) | `mitate.diagnosticOrder` lexicon の physicianAttestorDid (R2+) |\n| **G5** | **Emergency keyword detection → 即 ER routing fail-safe** ― anaphylaxis / orbital cellulitis / septal abscess / 髄膜炎徴候 / 視力低下 / 意識障害 等 を multi-language regex + LLM second-pass screen で検出 → 即 `mitate.emergencyEscalation` emit + 即 ER routing instruction + 全 advisory pipeline 中断 | this ADR | `emergency_screen` cell 自動 escalate; bypass 不可 |\n| **G6** | **Pediatric (<13 yr) / pregnancy / lactation / immunocompromised / 抗凝固薬服用中 → human review required** ― R1 advisory layer はこれらの群を独立判断せず human review (R1 = council medical advisory, R2+ = licensed MD) escalate flag を必ず立てる | ADR-2605192200 §2(f) | `rhinitis_triage` cell auto-escalate |\n| **G7** | **Insurance-claim filing automation 禁止 / 保険 / 雇用 / 広告 entities への health data 解読権付与禁止** ― AE-type Charter Rider §2(c) inheritance + 国内 個人情報保護法 要配慮個人情報 整合 | ADR-2605181100 + ADR-2605192200 §2(c) | sealed-recipient registry validator |\n| **G8** | **Charter Rider §2 全 clearance: 特定 brand 薬の宣伝禁止 (INN 表記のみ) / specialty cartel への loop-in 禁止 / paywall paywalled diagnostic insight 禁止** ― treatment plan advisory は INN (international nonproprietary name) で言及、ブランド名は yakushi-side product name のみ (religious-corp self-distributed) | ADR-2605192200 §2(c) + §2(e) | treatment plan content lint |\n| **G9** | **Training data = consent only + Council-attestation IRB-equivalent** ― mitate 内部 LLM の fine-tuning に使う patient narrative / diagnostic outcome は patient explicit consent record (G1 record の延長) + Council medical advisory review attestation 経由のみ;US Common Rule / 日本臨床研究法 倫理基準整合 | this ADR + ADR-2605192230 | `silenMitateReview` lexicon scope: `wave-1-training-data-consent-baseline` |\n| **G10** | **Model bias audit ― age / sex / pregnancy / language / income proxy 別の diagnostic accuracy demographic parity quarterly** ― 全 R2+ deploy 前 + R2+ deploy 中 quarterly に accuracy parity (top-3 condition recall, escalation rate) を測定、≥5% disparity は Council Lv6+ ≥ 3 attestation を要求 | this ADR + ADR-2605192100 §1.7 反個人主義 ontology + §1.13 Wellbecoming | `silenMitateReview` scope: `bias-audit-quarterly` |\n| **G11** | **Wellbecoming subordination check ― no notification spam / no addictive engagement design / no streak gamification / no fear-driven re-engagement** ― mitate PWA は patient-initiated only、push notification は urgency-only (emergency escalation acknowledgment + appointment reminder + adverse event followup の 3 種のみ) | ADR-2605192200 §2(h) | UX-level lint + `silenMitateReview` scope: `notification-channel-baseline` |\n| **G12** | **Murakumo-only inference (no commercial GPU)** ― 鑑別 LLM / image classifier (鼻内視鏡 image triage at R2+) は全て Murakumo fleet 経由;RunPod / Vertex / OpenAI direct / Anthropic direct from vendor key / Linode GPU / AWS Bedrock direct 禁止 | ADR-2605215000 + CHARTER-RIDER §2(i) | `e7m verify` |\n| **G13** | **全 diagnostic logic open-source (no proprietary classifier weights)** ― mitate の全 triage 重み / decision tree / LLM prompt template / Bayesian prior は Apache 2.0 + Charter Rider 配下で IPFS published、proprietary fine-tune weight 不可 | ADR-2605192315 + §2(e) | repo-side license lint |\n| **G14** | **4-phase R0→R3 (each phase = own ADR + Council attestation gate)** ― wadachi / baien / yakushi R0 pattern と完全整合;phase skipping 禁止 | this ADR + wadachi/baien/yakushi inheritance | Council attestation registry |\n\n## Decision 4 — Phased roadmap\n\n各 R-phase は別 ADR を要求。**R0 (this ADR) は scaffold + design only、advisory delivery / 検査 ordering / Rx recommendation は一切伴わない**。\n\n| Phase | Scope | Council attestation 要件 | 物理活動 | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **R0 (this ADR + 5 sub-ADRs)** | 6 ADR + actor scaffold + 8 lexicon + 13 mitate_* Pregel cells (全 import-time RuntimeError gate) + Murakumo fleet.toml design-only entry | 公開 review 30 日 + Council Lv6+ ≥ 3 sign-off (this charter) | **なし** ― scaffold ファイルのみ | proposed |\n| **R1** | self-care advisory PWA — rhinitis_intake + emergency_screen + medication_history_audit + rhinitis_triage の 4 cell のみ activate、検査・Rx は disclaimer 表示で `escalation = \"recommend-md-visit\"` を返すのみ。患者上限 = unlimited (advisory のみ) | R0 ratified + 1 licensed MD on Council medical advisory + G1/G2/G3/G5/G8/G9/G11/G13 baseline attestation | **R1 ADR + 別 commit** ― PWA deploy は ADR の中で narrated | ⏳ separate ADR |\n| **R2** | pilot — 1 community center + licensed-MD-in-loop, allergy_ige_panel_order + nasal_smear_eosinophil + nasal_endoscopy_acquire + rhinomanometry + paranasal_ct_route + treatment_router + outcome_qol_followup activate; 100 patient ceiling | R1 ratified + Council 5-of-7 Safe + 2 licensed MD on Council + bias audit baseline + Hanami robot mech design attestation | **R2 ADR + 別 commit** | ⏳ separate ADR |\n| **R3** | community-scale, multi-center, slit_cohort_tracker + ess_surgery_planner activate, Kafun-watch environmental sensor mesh deploy | R2 ratified + 公開 review 60 日 + jurisdiction 薬事 / 医療機器手続き (PMDA SaMD class I-II + 医療機関設置届 等) | **R3 ADR + 別 commit**;jurisdiction ごとに別 sub-ADR | ⏳ separate ADR |\n\n## Decision 5 — Non-goals (constitutional, explicit)\n\n| # | Non-goal | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| N1 | **Rx prescription issuance** | yakushi が OTC のみ、mitate も Rx 処方発行は physician's act ― advisory tier に留まる (G3 + G4) |\n| N2 | **Anaphylaxis / acute orbital cellulitis emergency response 自己完結** | G5 で ER routing 必須;mitate 自身は emergency response capacity を持たない (advisory 中断のみ) |\n| N3 | **Pediatric < 5 yr 自立判断** | 高度小児科専門知識領域;G6 で必ず human review escalate |\n| N4 | **Surgical execution / surgical orchestration** | ess_surgery_planner も surgical planning advisory only、執刀 surgeon-in-loop required (R3) |\n| N5 | **Insurance claim filing / claim 自動最適化** | G7;患者本人 + physician が判断 |\n| N6 | **Genetic testing / 遺伝子検査結果の medical interpretation** | Wave 2+;倫理 / 多世代 priority (§2(f)) 別 Council Lv6+ supermajority required |\n| N7 | **Mental health diagnosis (うつ・不安・精神病)** | 別 domain (`kokoro` か `iyashi` か別 actor candidate);Wave 2+ Council 別途検討 |\n| N8 | **Licensed physician 判断 override** | G3 + G4;mitate は physician の補助 (decision support tool)、代替ではない |\n| N9 | **Primary care 代替** | Advisory + routing only;general health maintenance / chronic disease management の primary care 代替は別 actor |\n| N10 | **終末期 / palliative care decision making** | 別 domain (高度倫理判断);Wave 2+ Council Lv6+ supermajority required |\n\n## Decision 6 — Substrate (binding)\n\nmitate は yakushi と同じ substrate 境界を継承:\n\n- **Primary write store** — AT MST + IPFS + Base L2 anchor via `@etzhayyim/sdk`\n- **Hot-path read** — `kotoba-datomic-projection` 許容 (cohort tracking, outcome time-series) ― deterministically rebuildable + `// kotoba-datomic-projection` marker\n- **Payments** — USDC on Base L2 + `TitheRouter.route()` (10% Tithe);用途 `donation` / `kisha` / `grant` / `tithe` / `internal-promo` (SBT↔SBT) のみ\n- **Patient identity** — Adherent SBT + passkey (R1+);rotating pseudonym DID for 30-day windows (G2 reinforcement)\n- **Physician identity** — path-based DID + hardware token (G13)\n- **Inference** — Murakumo fleet only (LiteLLM 127.0.0.1:4000 + EVO-X2 + Mac mini gemma4:e4b — gemma-coder-distill medical variant 経路、open weights only); commercial GPU rental 不可 (§2(i))\n\n## Decision 7 — Murakumo fleet placement (Phase R2+ post-Council)\n\nR0 では `50-infra/murakumo/fleet.toml` に design-only entry のみ (cell が import-time RuntimeError で gated)。R2 で Council attestation 後に実 deployment (R1 は advisory のみで levi のみ活性)。\n\n| Cell | 提案 Murakumo node | 理由 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `rhinitis_intake` | levi (audit leader, witness invariant pair) | symptom intake = patient-side attestation, witness pair |\n| `rhinitis_triage` | levi | 鑑別 = audit-style decision;gemma4:e4b distill medical variant も levi 経由 |\n| `medication_history_audit` | levi | 薬剤性 検出 = audit pattern (yakushi adverseEventReport の鏡像) |\n| `emergency_screen` | levi | fail-safe = audit-tier critical path |\n| `allergy_ige_panel_order` | naphtali (procurement / 検体 logistics) | IgE 検体は cold-chain routing 必要;naphtali = procurement + logistics leader |\n| `nasal_smear_eosinophil` | zebulun (chemistry / analytical leader) | 顕微鏡 + 鼻汁分析 = analytical wet workflow |\n| `nasal_endoscopy_acquire` | joseph (commissioning / sterile process) | Hanami robot operation = sterile process commissioning style |\n| `rhinomanometry` | joseph | 気流測定装置 commissioning |\n| `paranasal_ct_route` | simeon (commissioning / imaging facility coordination) | CT は外部 imaging facility routing |\n| `treatment_router` | levi | 5 条件 × 重症度 decision tree |\n| `slit_cohort_tracker` | levi | longitudinal cohort = audit-tier multi-year |\n| `ess_surgery_planner` | levi | surgical planning advisory = audit-tier (R3 surgeon-in-loop ack) |\n| `outcome_qol_followup` | levi | QOL time-series = audit-tier |\n\n(Murakumo fleet.toml の実 entry は R1 ADR + R2 ADR で land;この ADR では design intent のみ)\n\n## Decision 8 — yakushi sibling integration\n\nmitate と yakushi の cross-actor lexicon emit boundary を明示:\n\n| Direction | From cell | To cell (cross-actor) | Lexicon | Purpose |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| mitate → yakushi | `outcome_qol_followup` | yakushi `pharma_adverse_event` | `com.etzhayyim.pharma.adverseEventReport` | mitate が観察した薬剤副作用を yakushi-side AE registry に送る |\n| mitate → yakushi | `outcome_qol_followup` | yakushi `pharma_post_market_surveillance` | `com.etzhayyim.pharma.adverseEventReport` (aggregated) | longitudinal outcome data feed |\n| yakushi → mitate | `pharma_packaging` | mitate `medication_history_audit` | (内部 ID match) | yakushi lot を受領した patient が後日 medication_history_audit で acquire 履歴を見ることを許可 (consent 経由) |\n| yakushi → mitate | `pharma_adverse_event` | mitate `outcome_qol_followup` | (内部 ID match) | yakushi AE intake を mitate longitudinal tracker に back-feed |\n\ncross-actor lexicon は **新 namespace 増設なし** ― yakushi の `com.etzhayyim.pharma.adverseEventReport` を mitate も emit 可能 (substrate boundary 共有)。\n\n# Consequences\n\n**Positive**:\n\n- religious-corp の self-care / multi-generational liberation mission に「診断 advisory + treatment routing」を初めて explicitly carve out;§2(e) の constitutional counter-action 推進力が yakushi (drug-side) と相補的に visible\n- 5 条件 triage (鼻詰まり) は 最も静かな §2(f) clearance プロファイル ― 80 年級 multi-gen safety drug の活用 + lifestyle 介入 + 既知 evidence-based decision tree、Wave 1 reference として最低リスク\n- 14 constitutional gates と 10 non-goals が capability landing 前に visible になり、retrofit drift を防止 (wadachi / silicon Wave 1 / yakushi と同 pattern)\n- Murakumo fleet 既存 5 node (levi / naphtali / zebulun / joseph / simeon) を再利用、新 node 追加なし ― yakushi と同じ static operational footprint\n- yakushi との sibling boundary が medication AE feedback loop で物理的・意味的に閉じる ― religious-corp 内 self-care substrate の最初の完結した 2-actor 構成\n- sub-ADR 5 本 (2605260115 / 130 / 145 / 160 / 175) が 5 condition を分割するため individual review が並列化可能\n\n**Negative / costs**:\n\n- 医療 SaMD ガイドライン (PMDA / FDA / EU MDR class I-II) 適合は constitutional invariant の外側で発生する work load ― G4 (licensed MD-in-loop) を担う human resource が必要;Council medical advisory に R1 (= advisory tier) までに少なくとも 1 名、R2 (pilot) までに少なくとも 2 名の licensed MD adherent が整備されねば deploy 不能\n- patient consent (G1) + encrypted envelope (G2) + sealed-recipient 管理 は yakushi の AE-tier よりさらに重い key custody が必要 ― passkey rollover / 30-day rotating pseudonym DID / hardware token registry の運用コストが新規発生\n- 鼻内視鏡 image triage を R2+ で支援するためには domain-specific image classifier (Murakumo only, G12) を distill する必要 ― gemma-coder-distill の medical variant carve-out + image encoder + 鼻内視鏡 reference dataset が R2 critical path\n- 5 条件 triage の bias audit (G10) は demographic 別 prevalence 差を観察可能にする ― community 単位の bias signal が surface する正の副作用と、reproducible bias being community responsibility になる二重 cost\n\n**Risks**:\n\n- G3 (advisory only) と G4 (licensed MD-in-loop) の境界が community perception 上「事実上の診断」に滑り得る ― ADR-2605260200 (R1 ADR) で boundary signage の patient flow 上の表示位置 + UI 上の visual prominence を constitutional 明文化必要\n- G5 (emergency keyword screen) は false negative が致命的 ― R1 deploy 前に false negative rate adversarial testing baseline を Council attestation 経由で確立する必要;regex + LLM 二層では不十分な可能性\n- G9 (training data IRB-equivalent) は patient consent record の longitudinal 管理が複雑 ― consent revoke 時の training data deletion / model retraining workflow を R1 ADR で別 design 必要\n- G10 (bias audit) は demographic parity 違反 検出時の corrective action (model retraining / advisory text 変更 / community communication) の playbook を R2 ADR で別 design 必要\n- yakushi cross-actor feedback loop (Decision 8) は double-counting 防止 ― 同一 AE が yakushi `pharma_adverse_event` と mitate `outcome_qol_followup` の両方に来る場合の dedupe rule を R1 ADR + yakushi R1 ADR 共同で確立必要\n\n# Alternatives Considered\n\n## A. mitate を yakushi のサブ phase として埋め込む (Wave 2+)\n\nRejected. yakushi は drug 製造 actor;clinical advisory は **patient-initiated symptom interaction を起点とする能動 actor** であり、cell catalog の triggering pattern が yakushi (lot release / AE intake が起点) とほぼ独立。silicon (iwakura/fuigo/tsukuru) が kuni-umi 直下ではなく独立 actor として scaffold された理由と同じ ― scope domain が独立。\n\n## B. `kokoro` / `iyashi` / `shinsatsu` 等別命名\n\nConsidered. `shinsatsu` (診察) は最も直接的だが clinical 過ぎる印象 + religious-corp の institutional 距離感を縮め過ぎる。`iyashi` (癒し) は healing 含意で広範すぎる ― 別 actor (将来の伝統医学 / 心理 / palliative carve-out) に reserved。`mitate` は (i) 漢方 / 伝統医療の **症候を見極める知的行為** の歴史名、(ii) Yakushi Nyorai 左脇侍 日光菩薩 (insight) との echo、(iii) Japanese metaphor convention (kuni-umi / wadachi / yakushi / tsukuru / iwakura / fuigo) 整合 ― 三条件を満たす唯一。\n\n## C. mitate を 5 condition 全部に同時 land せず 1 condition から開始\n\nConsidered. e.g. allergic rhinitis (条件 1) のみ Wave 1 にして他 4 を Wave 2-5 に分割。Rejected for two reasons: (i) `treatment_router` cell が 5 条件 mutual differential を要求するため独立 carve-out 不可、(ii) 条件 5 (薬剤性鼻炎) は yakushi naphazoline label警告 (G11) と loop を組むため Wave 1 で組み込んでおく方が religious-corp 内 self-care substrate の constitutional 整合性が高い。\n\n## D. R0 で 5 sub-ADR ではなく 1 集約 sub-ADR\n\nConsidered. silicon Wave 1 は 4 sub-ADR (rtl / verilog / cad / robotics 系統別)、yakushi も 3 sub-ADR (synthesis / fill-finish / supply-chain)。Rejected for: mitate の 5 条件は yakushi の 3 process phase より condition 別の clinical reasoning が独立性高く、各 condition の bias audit / treatment guideline / G6 escalation profile が異なるため、reviewer が個別に audit できる利益が大きい。\n\n## E. condition lexicon を `com.etzhayyim.mitate.condition.<n>.*` で nested\n\nConsidered. e.g. `com.etzhayyim.mitate.condition.1.intake` 等。Rejected ― 5 condition の lexicon shape は intake / triage / order / result / plan / followup / silen-review / emergency の 8 axis でほぼ同一なため、condition-agnostic lexicon (各 record の `conditionId` field で condition 区別) の方が namespace 数 / schema 重複が少ない。\n\n## F. R1 advisory tier を独立 PWA ではなく既存 ameno PWA の extension\n\nConsidered. ameno は既存 self-care PWA ― mitate を extension にすれば PWA deploy / 認証 / Adherent SBT verify の初期 cost が下がる。Rejected for: (i) ameno = baien (LLM) inference UX が primary、mitate = medical advisory UX が primary、UX patterns が非整合 (medical disclaimer 表示は ameno 内 LLM chat と並ぶと patient 注意が分散)、(ii) R2 で licensed-MD-in-loop に拡張するとき MD 用 dashboard 専用 view が ameno 流の chat-style と integrability が低い。mitate-PWA は別 60-apps ディレクトリで R1 ADR で carve out。\n\n# References\n\n- ADR-2605192100 (etzhayyim Mission Charter — §1.5 free release of technology, §1.13 Wellbecoming, §1.6 synthetic religion)\n- ADR-2605192115 (economic substrate non-profit — G7 + N5)\n- ADR-2605192200 (Charter Compliance Rider v2.0 — §2(c)(e)(f)(h) gate sources, §2(e) \"legitimate technical safety oversight\" 例外)\n- ADR-2605192230 (Charters Compliance Registry attestation — G9 + Council Lv6+ ≥ 3 attestation pattern)\n- ADR-2605192315 (Transparent Religious Force — G13 mitate echo: silen-mitate-review pattern)\n- ADR-2605192400 (Eros/Gore content policy)\n- ADR-2605192415 (religious-corp daemon architecture — Tier-B classification, Murakumo placement pattern)\n- ADR-2605201400 (kuni-umi planetary infra — robotics class ontology, Hitogata / Mimi / Otete reuse + Hanami/Kafun-watch new placeholders)\n- ADR-2605181100 (encrypted confidentiality substrate — G2)\n- ADR-2605172000 (kotoba substrate — Decision 6 substrate boundary)\n- ADR-2605231500 (kotoba-datomic-projection — cohort tracking carve-out)\n- ADR-2605231525 (no-server-key invariant — G13 physician key custody)\n- ADR-2605215000 (etzhayyim inference Murakumo-only — G12)\n- ADR-2605250500 (yakushi pharmaceutical R&D charter — sibling Tier-B; cross-actor lexicon boundary Decision 8)\n- ADR-2605260115 (sub-ADR: condition 1 allergic rhinitis perennial, this wave)\n- ADR-2605260130 (sub-ADR: condition 2 vasomotor rhinitis, this wave)\n- ADR-2605260145 (sub-ADR: condition 3 chronic sinusitis, this wave)\n- ADR-2605260160 (sub-ADR: condition 4 septal deviation, this wave)\n- ADR-2605260175 (sub-ADR: condition 5 rhinitis medicamentosa, this wave)\n", :adr/path "90-docs/adr/2605260100-mitate-diagnostic-routing-charter.edn", :adr/source-repo "root", :adr/topic "mitate-diagnostic-charter", :adr/last_verified "2026-05-25", :adr/date "2026-05-25", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/related ["20-actors/mitate/                                # this ADR creates this tree" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/mitate_*/               # this ADR creates the 13 mitate Pregel cells" "00-contracts/lexicons/com/etzhayyim/mitate/      # this ADR creates the 8 mitate Lexicons" "50-infra/murakumo/fleet.toml                     # cell placement (Phase R2+ post-Council)"], :adr/authoritative_for ["mitate actor identity (name, DID pattern, tier) — religious-corp first-party diagnostic + treatment routing" "yakushi sibling boundary (yakushi = drug-side, mitate = clinical decision-side; same patient context, no overlap)" "Charter Rider §2 clearance reasoning for first-party medical advisory + diagnostic orchestration" "4-phase roadmap R0 → R3 with explicit Council-attestation gating per phase + licensed-MD-in-loop activation (R2)" "Diagnostic-specific constitutional gates G1..G14 (non-negotiable; differ from yakushi gates per medical scope)" "Non-goals N1..N10 (constitutional, not subject to incremental drift)" "Wave 1 reference target = chronic nasal congestion 5-condition triage (allergic rhinitis / vasomotor / chronic sinusitis / septal deviation / rhinitis medicamentosa)" "Sub-ADR registry (ADR-2605260115 / 2605260130 / 2605260145 / 2605260160 / 2605260175)"]}]
